5,1,1,talk,Mio,,"Hi everyone! Let's get this sorted. I really want to avoid guessing the numbers this time, so I'll look into the last year's ledger of outgoings and the bank statements on last year's renewals.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I think it would be wise to understand the current atmosphere. I'll check the weekday turnout since the summer outings and the quieter members at the winter social.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I want to see who is actually doing the work and showing up. I'll take the tally of the sign-in sheets and the rota against the attendance record.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I will examine the outgoing treasurer's logged hours and the sign-up records for mid-year joiners to understand the administrative burden.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I'll check the taster evening forms from non-joiners and the minute books from the named-grade years to see how people feel about joining!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,Does anyone else think we should look at the sign-in sheets too? I'm worried we might miss something if only one person checks them.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I believe Takumi has a firm handle on the attendance data, but I am open to sharing my findings on the social atmosphere if that helps.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"I've got the sign-in sheets covered, Mio. I'll be thorough, so you don't need to waste your time on them.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"I believe the current distribution of tasks is sufficient. We are covering the financial, administrative, and social aspects of the club quite comprehensively.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I agree with Toshio! We've got all the bases covered. I'm excited to see what the non-joiners had to say on those forms!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,Fair enough! I'll stick with the ledger and bank statements then. I just want to make sure we have a solid foundation for the numbers.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. Having a clear picture of both the finances and the members' feelings will ensure we make a balanced decision.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"I'm just focused on the fairness of it all. If a few people are doing everything, the fee structure needs to reflect that reality.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"I agree that fairness is important, though we must also ensure the system is sustainable for the person managing the accounts.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I just want to make sure we don't make it too scary for new people to join. Let's see what the records tell us!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,I'm happy with our plan then! Let's all go do our research and come back to share what we've found. See you all soon!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I shall return shortly with my findings. Until then.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Takumi,,I'm on it. I'll find out exactly who's been carrying the load. See you in a bit.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I will begin my review of the records now. I look forward to seeing how our findings align.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Kenji,,Me too! I'll go see what those forms and minute books have to say. Good luck everyone!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
